<title>BELGIUM: Sabena has 1996 8.87 bln Bfr loss.</title>
<headline>Sabena has 1996 8.87 bln Bfr loss.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(billion Belgian francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Cons loss after provisions	  8.87 vs 1.66 loss</p>
<p>    exceptional charges		   4.1  vs  n/a</p>
<p>    non-cons loss after provisions    8.32 vs 1.99 loss</p>
<p>    non-cons operating loss	     4.05 vs 0.003 profit</p>
<p>    Non-cons cash flow		 -2.40   vs  1.54</p>
<p>    restructuring charges	     1.5    vs   n/a</p>
<p>    depreciation on fleet	     1.5    vs   n/a</p>
<p>    operating income		   60.63   vs 59.35</p>
<p>NOTE - Belgian national carrier Sabena is 49.5 percent owned by Swissair.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6815, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
